# flow/cov/ahb_report.tcl maps that top onto the simulation's instance path.
# Commented lines need IMC's
# block / expression / bin identifiers and are completed in IMC.
# =============================================================================
# CL-DEF-STATE3 (unreachable, line) TO COMPLETE IN IMC: rtl/ahb/ahb_default_slave.v ^line:93 case
#   reason  : The state register is 2 bits with three states (IDLE, ERR1, ERR2); the `default:` arm is the recovery for the unused encoding 2'd3, which no transition produces.
#   evidence: PROVEN fv_ahb ahb_prove a_def_state_legal (rtl/ahb/ahb_ic_props_a.sv, def_state != 2'd3, abc pdr, unbounded), 2026-10-14
